#: kcmlocale.cpp:1749
msgid ""
"<p>Here you can define the digit grouping used to display monetaryvalues.</"
"p><p>Note that the digit grouping used to display other numbers has to be "
"defined separately (see the 'Numbers' tab).</p>"
msgstr ""

